        - !<reference> 48a258cf-53fe-4af7-5b02-3612050c26d1
      exampleInfo: !<string[]>
        - "InteractionKit and UIKit showcase. Pick a showcase on the far panel: grab and throw the jellyfish, drag the crystal chain, poke the crystal to shrink it, or pinch it to spin and grow it. Each one has its own controls. The Color panel button opens a near panel that tints the crystals and the jellyfish."
        - "UIKit layouts and components: menus, grids, a carousel, a text area, a modal, a card deck and a chat. Scroll the lists and press the buttons."
        - "InteractionKit patterns: grab and move objects, grab the sphere to pilot the spaceship across the galaxy and push the particles along its path, and toggle one- and two-handed scale and rotate modes."
      steps: !<reference.SceneObject[]>
        - !<reference> f5412358-3e67-4b1d-82ee-9fa966e9b17b
